# The model broker's settings (docs/guide/operations/model-broker.md). Its secrets are not here: they
# are root's files in /etc/data-director/credentials/model-broker/, which the unit loads.

# Where the harness publishes the keys it signs model grants with: the app's /.well-known/jwks.json,
# once it has its three model-grant secrets. Or DD_BROKER_HARNESS_JWKS_FILE, a copy of that JSON.
# With neither, the broker refuses every grant.
#DD_BROKER_HARNESS_JWKS_URL=http://127.0.0.1:7860/.well-known/jwks.json

# Where the deployment's own calls go when the broker pays for them, such as the LiteLLM gateway
# (deploy/llm-gateway/README.md). Unset: straight to the provider.
#DD_BROKER_DEPLOYMENT_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4000

# Origins a person's own openai-compatible account may name as its base URL, comma-separated, and
# those of them that may resolve to a private address (an endpoint inside the institution).
#DD_BROKER_ALLOWED_BASE_URLS=
#DD_BROKER_PRIVATE_BASE_URLS=
